      "writtenOn": "2022-10-14T13:08:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we get consistent error messages, and centralize the logic by moving the check to the front-end? We\u0027d just need a shader-caps bit for rect-samplers being allowed, and if it\u0027s not set, we could even do the lazy thing of adding an alias from those types to poison/invalid?",
